INSERT OR REPLACE INTO messages (id, channel_id, sender_id, content, attachments, nonce, created_at, reply_to_id, reply_to_content, reply_to_author) VALUES ('announcement_server_maintenance_telemetry', 'announcements', '4fecc8e6-2d27-4560-886b-ec88edeaa48a', '🛠️ **OFFICIAL INFRASTRUCTURE & SERVER MAINTENANCE TELEMETRY**
*Cloudflare Global Edge • D1 Distributed SQLite Replication • Tailscale Mesh Resilience*

The Connecto Infrastructure Operations Team has verified and synchronized server maintenance status across all regional edge nodes and primary clusters.

---

### 🌐 **1. CLOUDFLARE GLOBAL WORKERS & EDGE FAILOVER**
• **Edge Worker**: `vconnect-maintenance` running on Cloudflare Global Edge network across 300+ PoPs.
• **Origin Health Routing**: Automated origin health probing with zero-downtime failover to standby maintenance UI during node migrations.
• **D1 SQLite Edge Replication**: Read-replica synchronization to D1 edge database instances with sub-10ms localized latency.

---

### 🔒 **2. TAILSCALE SECURE MESH CLUSTER (box-1)**
• **Primary Ingress Node**: `box-1` (`100.87.184.30`) fully patched and secured.
• **Reverse Proxy**: Caddy 2 HTTP/3 reverse proxy with TLS 1.3 cryptographic termination.
• **Daemon Health**: `fastapi.service` active and healthy, zero memory leakage, automated systemd restart supervisor enabled.
• **Database Integrity**: Dual WAL (Write-Ahead Logging) checkpoints active across `connecto.db` and SQLite transaction layers.

---

### ⚡ **3. WEBRTC MESH & AUDIO SIGNALING PIPELINE**
• **Signaling Heartbeat**: Real-time 45s keepalive pings with low-latency reconnection retry loop.
• **STUN / TURN Fallback**: Dual-tier ICE candidate discovery with zero-loss fallback signaling.
• **Maintenance Window**: Completed successfully with 100% service uptime recorded.', '{}', NULL, '2026-10-02T10:59:13.731697+00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO messages (id, channel_id, sender_id, content, attachments, nonce, created_at, reply_to_id, reply_to_content, reply_to_author) VALUES ('announcement_v398_release_updates', 'announcements', '4fecc8e6-2d27-4560-886b-ec88edeaa48a', '🚀 **CONNECTO PLATFORM RELEASE v3.9.8 IS LIVE!**
*Phone View Layout Overhaul • Profile Pictures in Notifications • WebRTC Call Hangup & Mute Fixes • Desktop 1200px Bounded View • Real-Time Online Comrades Highlighting*

We are proud to release **Connecto Platform Update v3.9.8**, addressing core mobile usability, multimedia notifications, WebRTC calling reliability, responsive desktop centering, and real-time community presence!

---

### 📱 **1. RESPONSIVE PHONE VIEW ARCHITECTURE**
• **Zero Horizontal Overflow**: Resolved 390px mobile viewport clipping across iPhone & Android devices with strict CSS containment.
• **Compact Floating Composer**: Bottom composer dock redesigned with zero screen occlusion and thumb-friendly ergonomics.
• **Slide-Over Navigation Drawer**: Channel and DM navigation drawer smoothly slides over the viewport with instant touch backdrop dismissal.

---

### 🔔 **2. NOTIFICATION CENTER & SENDER PROFILE AVATARS**
• **Toast Avatars**: Real-time notification banners now render the sender personalized profile picture in place of generic icons.
• **Notification Dropdown Tray**: The unread alert center (`#notifList`) renders high-resolution user avatars with unread indicator badges.

---

### 📞 **3. WEBRTC CALLING ENGINE & DISCONNECT TEARDOWN**
• **Mute / Unmute Synchronization**: Interactive audio track toggle with instant visual feedback and bidirectional signaling.
• **Instant Remote Hangup**: Fixed state desynchronization where cut calls remained active; peer disconnect and ICE teardown now terminate sessions immediately across all participants.

---

### 💻 **4. BALANCED DESKTOP LAYOUT (BOUNDED 1200PX)**
• **Full-Viewport Backgrounds**: Seamless edge-to-edge dark/light backgrounds spanning 100% of the display.
• **Bounded Content Grids**: Centered content containers strictly capped at 1200px max-width to prevent UI distortion on ultra-wide monitors.

---

### 🟢 **5. REAL-TIME PRESENCE & ONLINE COMRADES ENGINE**
• **Dynamic Online Highlighting**: Active online comrades glow with vivid green status indicators (`#4ade80`).
• **Strict Presence Partitioning**: Dynamically separates online members from offline comrades across channel rosters and friend lists.

---

### 🎨 **6. DUAL-THEME COLOR SYSTEM PARITY (WEB & ANDROID)**
• **Pure Black OLED (Noir)**: True `#000000` canvas, `#080808` surfaces, `#FFFFFF` crisp text, and vibrant status accents.
• **Ivory Paper (Parchment)**: Warm archival `#FBF8F2` canvas, pure `#FFFFFF` cards, `#141312` Sumi ink text, and `#E7E2D8` borders.
• **Identical Color Parity**: Android Native application theme engine now matches the web editorial palette 1:1.', '{}', NULL, '2026-10-02T10:59:13.735101+00:00', NULL, NULL, NULL);
